Changes:
 gsad (24.16.0-1+gsa28compat5) kali-rolling; urgency=medium
 .
   * Accept either installed GVM runtime ABI (22 or 23) at build time.
     Select matching private public headers and explicit SONAMEs without
     installing or replacing libgvm-dev or either runtime package.
   * Validate ELF linkage and generated dependency against the selected ABI.
   * Preserve the GSA 28.3.0 login/session fix from the previous revision.
